                                                "sense_id": "3aff0006-5768-3c92-99e4-e6a5feeb2a27",
                                                "text": "Given a veritable Pagan's Paddock by the Cats to work in on Friday night, Danger booted two goals in the first seven minutes to send Geelong fans into orbit."
